      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROCKELLA (8) was out of the money two runs back at this track then was at his best last start to score by 1.5 metres over 1710m at Ballarat. Can settle just behind them and wait on the sprint lane. It doesn't get any easier but he is capable of another big performance. DRESSED IN GOLD NZ (10) is in good form at present. Finished third at his latest appearance over 2240m at this track, beaten 3.5 metres. Not drawn to best so may need a 10/10 drive. In the mix with luck in running. KATUNGA EXPRESS (7) has been about the mark of late and must be respected, the latest offering a sound fifth at Riverina Paceway over 1740m. Top-three candidate. YARRAMAN JOLT (5) is a last-start winner who shouldn't be underestimated.",
